      "statement": "Advertised peer addresses are typed as a socket address or an unresolved hostname (reachability is defined per peer network), and advertise_scope classifies loopback/private/shared-overlay versus the 'operator-routed network' literal public IPs that celld rejects without --unsafe-public-advertise.",
