    {
      "id": "claim_1538e0a1a7cd4964a1068ddae5467053",
      "statement": "The Actor holds only executor bookkeeping: pending route replies, handoff timing, gated outputs keyed by request+channel with per-cell FIFO WebSocket gates so no client sees a frame that trails an unproven write, and a fence channel that carries the core's halt decision to the process.",
      "evidence": [
